{"speciesId":139,"names":{"fr":"Amonistar","es":"Omastar","en":"Omastar","ja":"オムスター"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"A prehistoric POKéMON that died out when its heavy shell made it impossible to catch prey."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"A prehistoric POKéMON that died out when its heavy shell made it impossible to catch prey."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Sharp beaks ring its mouth. Its shell was too big for it to move freely, so it became extinct."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Apparently, it cracked SHELLDER's shell with its sharp fangs and sucked out the insides."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Once wrapped around its prey, it never lets go. It eats the prey by tearing at it with sharp fangs."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Its heavy shell allowed it to reach only nearby food. This could be the reason it is extinct."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"OMASTAR uses its tentacles to capture its prey. It is believed to have become extinct because its shell grew too large and heavy, causing its movements to become too slow and ponderous."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"OMASTAR uses its tentacles to capture its prey. It is believed to have become extinct because its shell grew too large and heavy, causing its movements to become too slow and ponderous."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"An OMASTAR uses its tentacles to capture its prey. It is believed to have become extinct because its shell grew too large, making its movements slow and ponderous."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its tentacles are highly developed as if they are hands and feet. As soon as it ensnares prey, it bites."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Despite having strong fangs and tentacles, it went extinct when its heavy shell made it unable to catch prey."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Apparently, it cracked SHELLDER’s shell with its sharp fangs and sucked out the insides."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Once wrapped around its prey, it never lets go. It eats the prey by tearing at it with sharp fangs."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On pense que ce Pokémon a disparu parce que sa coquille en spirale était devenue trop grosse."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On pense que ce Pokémon a disparu parce que sa coquille en spirale était devenue trop grosse."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses tentacules sont développés comme s’il s’agissait de bras ou de jambes. Dès qu’il attrape une proie, il la mord."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene los tentáculos tan desarrollados que le sirven de manos y pies. Con ellos atrapa a su presa y le da un bocado."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its tentacles are highly developed as if they are hands and feet. As soon as it ensnares prey, it bites."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"触手が 手足のように 発達している。しがみつくと 同時に かみついてくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Une fois enroulé autour de sa proie, il ne la laisse pas repartir et la dévore avec ses crocs."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando agarra a su presa, nunca la deja escapar. Se la come despedazándola con sus colmillos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Once wrapped around its prey, it never lets go. It eats the prey by tearing at it with sharp fangs."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"一度 巻きついたら 絶対に 離れない。鋭い キバで 獲物を 引き裂くように 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Amonistar utilise ses tentacules pour capturer ses proies. On pense que l’espèce s’est éteinte parce que sa coquille était devenue trop grande et trop lourde, ce qui rendait ses mouvements lents et pesants."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Omastar usa los tentáculos para atrapar a su presa. Se cree que el motivo de su extinción fue el tamaño y el peso que llegó a alcanzar la concha que lleva a cuestas, lo que le entorpeció y ralentizó los movimientos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Omastar uses its tentacles to capture its prey. It is believed to have become extinct because its shell grew too large and heavy, causing its movements to become too slow and ponderous."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"触手を 操り 獲物を 捕まえる。 カラが 大きく なり過ぎた ことで 動きが 鈍くなり 絶滅したと 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Amonistar utilise ses tentacules pour capturer ses proies. On pense que l’espèce s’est éteinte parce que sa coquille était devenue trop grande et trop lourde, ce qui rendait ses mouvements lents et pesants."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Omastar usa los tentáculos para atrapar a su presa. Se cree que el motivo de su extinción fue el tamaño y el peso que llegó a alcanzar la concha que lleva a cuestas, lo que le entorpeció y ralentizó los movimientos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Omastar uses its tentacles to capture its prey. It is believed to have become extinct because its shell grew too large and heavy, causing its movements to become too slow and ponderous."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"触手を 操り 獲物を 捕まえる。 カラが 大きく なり過ぎた ことで 動きが 鈍くなり 絶滅したと 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"On suppose que ce Pokémon antique a disparu en raison de la lourdeur de sa coquille. Il est l’ancêtre présumé des Octillery."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un posible antepasado remoto de Octillery cuya extinción se cree debida a que su concha se hizo demasiado pesada."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its heavy shell is thought to be the reason this ancient Pokémon died out. It’s apparently a distant ancestor of Octillery."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"重いカラが 原因で 滅んだと 考えられている 古代ポケモン。 オクタンの 遠い 祖先 らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il immobilise ses proies avec ses tentacules et leur inflige le coup de grâce à l’aide de ses crocs aiguisés."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Atrapa a sus presas con los tentáculos y, una vez inmovilizadas, las desgarra con sus afilados colmillos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It wraps its prey in its tentacles to immobilize them and then finishes them off with its sharp fangs."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"触手で 獲物を からめとり 身動きを 封じて 鋭い キバで 止めを 刺すのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Sa bouche est formée de crocs aiguisés. Il aurait disparu car sa coquille, trop grosse, l’empêchait de se déplacer facilement."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Poseía unos colmillos afilados, pero el excesivo tamaño de su concha le impedía moverse con libertad, lo que acabó provocando su extinción."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Its sharp beak rings its mouth. Its shell was too big for it to move freely, so it became extinct."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"鋭い キバを 持っていたが カラが 大きすぎて うまく 動けず 絶滅 したらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Sa bouche est formée de crocs aiguisés. Il aurait disparu car sa coquille, trop grosse, l’empêchait de se déplacer facilement."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Poseía unos colmillos afilados, pero el excesivo tamaño de su concha le impedía moverse con libertad, lo que acabó provocando su extinción."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Its sharp beak rings its mouth. Its shell was too big for it to move freely, so it became extinct."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"鋭い キバを 持っていたが カラが 大きすぎて うまく 動けず 絶滅 したらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il se serait éteint à cause de la taille et du poids importants de sa coquille, qui le ralentissait quand il chassait ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se cree que se extinguió porque el excesivo tamaño y peso de su concha le impedían moverse con rapidez para capturar presas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Weighed down by a large and heavy shell, Omastar couldn’t move very fast. Some say it went extinct because it was unable to catch food."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"大きく 重い 殻のせいで 動きが 鈍くなり 獲物を 獲れずに 絶滅した という。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses crocs sont capables de broyer la roche, mais il ne peut s’attaquer qu’aux proies à portée de ses tentacules."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Posee unos colmillos afilados con los que puede partir piedras, pero solo ataca a presas que se hallan al alcance de sus tentáculos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Omastar’s sharp fangs could crush rock, but the Pokémon can attack only the prey that come within reach of its tentacles."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"鋭いキバは 岩も 砕くが 触手の とどく 範囲の 獲物しか 襲えないのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":139,"moves":[{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns"